filter × event matches NIP-01 semantics\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/nostr/filter.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"b5d05d0ed6824ccea7311e8c4787933c5479f9b4587a39116b6c60868db5bde6fe8431fd18dec0a26b8d0cb4679aa39603fe448041c3aab541da21368732a175\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"c7d26a5ea3f1c52cbaa3d03037f170c7aa3f40ce46e9b004c659794a9ae34ec0\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215599,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"78f3558f1975babb59910e79b424de75f48dd60a8154557f6531729820acb088\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"78f3558f1975babb59910e79b424de75f48dd60a8154557f6531729820acb088\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"Open today's sealed deck natively with the Coax stack\"],[\"t\",\"nostr\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"ca06a75181b2db380cb5e9a2522c0910d784670c1c2ce0f5f245e9be5e3793b9\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"ef5aa35ce36cfdd1bf6ed0c89e20ebaa292e896adedf1fb553e03c4f6204a432\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"fdce7d97951b382e2d14adec11c47a90ddfad1987a5c19d9cfef0619d30f637f\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: Open today's sealed deck natively with the Coax stack\"]],\"content\":\"A native test that fetches the sealed test deck's wrap fixture (checked in from the scratch e2e, test deck only), unwraps it with the recipient test key, checks the 3188 envelope digest and prints the slide titles.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Prints the two test-deck slide titles; digest matches\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/tests/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"9a46f9312be057ffd81dcf4a2b04815c6114a9914dc2396236b5d063456b5043392f080a5c6deaa7df92b6c96ed1fa38683