mb method with a table generated by #run (32 KB variant for the page, 64 KB native); every lookup through ge_table_select; no secret branches.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- 100,000 random k match the harness\\n- Timing harness |t| < 4.5 over 10^6 runs, fixed vs random k, native\\n- Release wasm grows by ≤ 40 KB\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_mult.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"933260829abbb4e52924f1b042c0f9314369dc50e478df0ebe8763ed2d200d311e44983e143d8b6dc4ab1fdeefb3849ae8140704641d34fca3dde02f42230c42\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"0c151e4837c95de698458e8e5af69e02df619c8a05c248669826b206d8e1b2f0\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215588,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"0bd17619f83ed2dc6152e607c9aca14402a83a589be838a6d80ca18f99db0b0d\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"0bd17619f83ed2dc6152e607c9aca14402a83a589be838a6d80ca18f99db0b0d\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"A dudect-style constant-time timing harness\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"t\",\"tools\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"parent\",\"3021a5a2952db48a66482951d1f2cc86b59131ad7911ab95ae34e1992c833e92\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: A dudect-style constant-time timing harness\"]],\"content\":\"tools/coax-nostr/timing/: fixed-vs-random class runs with Welch's t-test, native (Apple silicon and x86-64) and a wasm32 report mode.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Flags a deliberately branching ct_eq (|t| > 10) and passes the real ct_eq (|t| < 4.5)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/timing/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"5144abe1a5b70ed1c977d8b34d2ad58b4fa4a0f5f592dd6fc5ec3a3e9589520d0517bc1ee5e931ae9ea208b71a86308cdce31a1f6eb1d74cf54f89a8b1ecb504\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"afeeb8537428431e4e0bb26e6334ed98102d5fa434e80769450b3918a7a6c666\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215587,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"69431a57b1c90581f1d71cbf5139e9413287fd9aefb0616548c3d7bed6f1333b\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"69431a57b1c90581f1d71cbf5139e9413287fd9aefb0616548c3d7bed6f1333b\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"The page verifies one real event in Coax\"],[\"t\",\"web\"],[\"t\",\"nostr\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"415aa469756162d066415e784a66144b7217e3c58a11390b85bf34eeec6f3c82\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"41bdfb8f0861f587a6f0b7b8aa9e47b854da9dde7e1d659913eb0ac28e94926c\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: The page verifies one real event in Coax\"]],\"content\":\"A dev-only probe page under apps/openagents-web loads one event JSON baked at build time (fetched from relay.openagents.com by the build), recomputes its id with a minimal serializer, verifies the signature and draws VERIFIED or REFUSED.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Probe screenshot shows VERIFIED for a real event and REFUSED when one hex digit of sig is changed\\n- check-visuals.sh passes\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `apps/openagents-web/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"9b1c11774394f19f40f3fb8a1a41dab219062634baf9c4dd2561a2e94a5941e9a34c57a65cd9b605e8ddebf32dbe7c73b7e8b42e3f74a97962e1c4b4920f79f2\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"e3986a0b809e89ee799