da780296456\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"4747fbcbf213e5c9af2f8f7d793a9b19f3b0d9ef23259ea776670da780296456\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"f20e2fcf01473864c4e6a74bda37893d2c7b3705e68e00b759902cb0395b28f9\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/pbkdf2.coax for the phrase gate (210,000 rounds); reuse the HMAC inner/outer state per round.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- RFC 7914 §11 vectors pass\\n- 210,000 rounds take under 400 ms in wasm32 in Chrome\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/pbkdf2.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"f3a781bb1ff25f7eac265eafaa8b4eef6e48ebe791da8622c6d6b8ec1a5e2e05c9b248a0e974a7e3b003663f5b66848b00156a54582c12792dbae7b26cee51e1\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"344ee8258f5ff807f20195e061624d87e1d70d2ede00df1c50aaad57ec7e8b38\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215575,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"f20e2fcf01473864c4e6a74bda37893d2c7b3705e68e00b759902cb0395b28f9\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"f20e2fcf01473864c4e6a74bda37893d2c7b3705e68e00b759902cb0395b28f9\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"HMAC-SHA256 and HKDF\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"67846980e155bd984c7c9b0791191732f3a7921615bc413bbf7ecd168ca1b292\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: HMAC-SHA256 and HKDF\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/hmac.coax and hkdf.coax: hmac_sha256(key, msg), HKDF extract and expand (NIP-44 uses expand with 76 bytes).\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- RFC 4231 cases 1–7 and RFC 5869 cases 1–3 pass\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/hmac.coax`\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/hkdf.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"e64a272e764595d0321305745d674ead802031128a219aba43f0949f21a0c1896aa833f5565f24625bbb4b92240d20a7898f1dabf1ee4cc4ab04dcbbe7227a0a\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"7bb049f6e1a683b615a45217201a3a58e2e4f1b5613569c5339806239fbad8c6\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215574,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"67846980e155bd984c7c9b0791191732f3a7921615bc413bbf7ecd168ca1b292\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"67846980e155bd984c7c9b0791191732f3a7921615bc413bbf7ecd168ca1b292\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"SHA-256, streaming and one-shot, with the BIP-340 tagged hash\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"0e80305628f5865f8215377b9ea71ee3a220fce2813307c148f3319fc0508643\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: SHA-256, streaming and one-shot, with the BIP-340 tagged hash\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/sha256.coax: init/update/final over views, one-shot sha256, and tagged_hash(tag, msg) = SHA256(SHA256(tag)||SHA256(tag)||msg) with the three BIP-340 tags' prefixes precomputed with #run.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- NIST subset and the 1 MiB split-at-every-chunk test pass in the vector runner\\n- #test: empty, \\\"abc\\\", tagged hash of BIP0340/challenge known value\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n- ≥ 150 MB/s in wasm32, ≥ 300 MB/s native (bench printed)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/sha256.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"3a30cb26a0ac00b01ddb2aab7b918223a596f0ea1578e54eafbce28d5e47a9b513fa91d3deb5ac46c1e0ee5e981a5dfa9acd47d6a3acfeacba27754197b0d04d\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"ce8a98083d9442e0c626bd487f107336a8e6041341e8ea3182b475b940286ffd\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215573,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"0e80305628f5865f8215377b9ea71ee3a220fce2813307c148f3319fc0508643\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"0e80305628f5865f8215377b9ea71ee3a220fce2813307c148f3319fc0508643\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"A native vector runner for Coax crypto modules\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"t\",\"tools\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"ef110244163f42af67495669bf9b2dad025e3f1fe652c59637927a9640315259\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: A native vector runner for Coax crypto modules\"]],\"content\":\"tools/coax-nostr/vectors.sh builds each module with `coax c` → clang with ASan/UBSan and runs a C driver per vector file, reporting pass/fail per row. Heavy vectors run here; small ones also run as #test.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Runs on macOS with the existing toolchain\\n- Fails loudly on a single wrong row (tested by corrupting one expected value in a temp copy)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/vectors.sh`\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/vectors/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"eab54b51d379cdb9df0e98a994e8be2616d9d8671b43f2673c2be0879b203ca838eb709726870f2582dc7edb771cf408af46e4e5acc9b8865ec9c5e4b1187f19\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"ab1fb097dde6748534478fa16a788b0f7341a9402ce6c8d61d4b3c1c27b805d3\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215572,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"ef110244163f42af67495669bf9b2dad025e3f1fe652c59637927a9640315259\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"ef110244163f42af67495669bf9b2dad025e3f1fe652c59637927a9640315259\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"Pin the official test vectors with their sources and hashes\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: Pin the official test vectors with their sources and hashes\"]],\"content\":\"Create coax/tests/vectors/ with the files listed in coax/nostr.md §9.1 (NIST SHA-256 subset, RFC 4231, 5869, 7914, 8439, BIP-340 CSV, Wycheproof ecdh_secp256k1, NIP-44 vectors, BIP-173) and SOURCES.md recording URL, retrieval date and SHA-256 of each.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Every file in SOURCES.md matches its recorded SHA-256 (a check script)\\n- No file is modified from upstream\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/tests/vectors/`\\n- `coax/tests/vectors/SOURCES.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"fe86caf2ffee0d38752145be57ffa03bba07be86d6ec1e077f8fa3cb26acfafdfc03b663c5ccc098401452dbc8707153b18383b3364a4b13b9939a9657378692\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"d222c33e599a6a2b187540f7be948ce7a82ec09abab78f3212b02001da30f630\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215571,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"Byte helpers: big/little-endian loads, constant-time equality, select and zeroize\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: Byte helpers: big/little-endian loads, constant-time equality, select and zeroize\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/bytes.coax: load/store be32/le32/be64/le64, ct_eq over views (returns a mask), ct_select for u32/u64 and views, zeroize through the value barrier (a #foreign no-op until the intrinsic lands).\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- #test covers every helper at boundaries\\n- coax mutate coax/lib/crypto/bytes.coax: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/bytes.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"f7dd38c32e7d196ae7bbfe96ebc225e50605b7a54dd491b6412fe9a560a8d3e8d20452a3a854c5b1b101e0a22e7cb18d602cbaf0abe27a4d63fb39a3554b87ec\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"29a0a4af3f5620ca9c992f3109c3c7da4a77cf69d5efc809c1640f54bf0d6e78\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215570,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"7e3934a9c0d037a0aedd82652a39ce54157d1a653cd8100c4e7bdf66a00c70ca\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"7e3934a9c0d037a0aedd82652a39ce54157d1a653cd8100c4e7bdf66a00c70ca\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"Debug-only struct fields and checks\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: Debug-only struct fields and checks\"]],\"content\":\"A way to declare fields and statements that exist only in development builds (spec §10.5 conditional compilation, the minimal slice), so field elements can carry magnitudes in debug and not in release.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- A struct with a debug-only field has a smaller size_of in --release; statements under the debug condition are absent from release C\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"2024b7bff2dea4d11152ff04f716935904fd26e3a243943b9b870d5c68b515566d53dca54b6aaf1b98e0f6cc337e8de1ac8a0bed9e237119947548f6c7bc79fc\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"11b37db53fe98d9e188d2574f6278f6c693b829e9e429d5bd415a2df3d32758b\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215569,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"cead935db7ace271e21900abbc2d2df3a2de667b26fde55a957a22b9e6cd446c\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"cead935db7ace271e21900abbc2d2df3a2de667b26fde55a957a22b9e6cd446c\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"mul_wide: a 64×64→128 multiply as two u64 halves\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"optional\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: mul_wide: a 64×64→128 multiply as two u64 halves\"]],\"content\":\"Add `mul_wide(a, b: u64) -> (hi, lo: u64)`: C emits `unsigned __int128`; wasm32 emits a four-multiply split. Enables a 5×52 field on native later.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Random and edge vectors match a reference computed with __int128 on native and in wasm32 (node or a headless page)\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"f4221b0cb91ab04de66990f63aa37ac6bc11617a687e2a8a2a002d2960f58a18fee45c3747081f9c19409b2a432b7ac9873a38306d27fa0769941024744383d8\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"5d9c08fe490d1c29549b82562f3b80603fe82621951eb38ef65c64bd79521218\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215568,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"0ad56dd04b3014052d86aa154588c49234d1ff82c0d221eeaf254802e9b14202\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"0ad56dd04b3014052d86aa154588c49234d1ff82c0d221eeaf254802e9b14202\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"Explicit wrapping add and rotate for u32 and u64\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"optional\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: Explicit wrapping add and rotate for u32 and u64\"]],\"content\":\"Add `add_wrap`, `sub_wrap`, `mul_wrap`, `rotl`, `rotr` for u32/u64 that never trap in any build mode. SHA-256 and ChaCha20 can use them instead of computing in u64 and masking.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Tests for each op at the type's limits in debug and --release\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"403a8188a15eceb07c856b5bef0111d216fa4aa25be91efef67edf643598bf83be991ed7d5958f484a2c5bbfd0cfa652ff5f88924a9508bd65871f6a3babe859\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"5187d1e52fced4d8cbd1d6f68dc44a0ff5610664d0065f25f141c2f2a0feb46e\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215567,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"b17db3e238f978ff3415d8c228eb42683128322d8ba8212a81b823eabc4748a7\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"b17db3e238f978ff3415d8c228eb42683128322d8ba8212a81b823eabc4748a7\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"A value_barrier intrinsic for constant-time code\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: A value_barrier intrinsic for constant-time code\"]],\"content\":\"Add `value_barrier(x: u64) -> u64` (and u32) that the optimizer cannot see through: native emits `__asm__(\\\"\\\" : \\\"+r\\\"(x))`, wasm32 emits a call to a non-inlined identity. Document it in coax/spec.md §9.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Generated C for a masked select compiled with clang -O2 contains no conditional branch on the masked value (checked by objdump in a test script)\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n- `coax/tests/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"8d1d1154602904547a81c3532bb10335f738caf8ba69a12d48f7d4d815f207036e71223db3a999bc5fce1f9c8b24bb9ca36550f84343d55a7abe80f3d2d4accf\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"comments\",{\"id\":\"ffcb0c5f7c257acd3fbfb0fbf643404ae3ca88539ea7e92aa6ba67df807f7d5c\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793215566,\"kind\":1111,\"tags\":[[\"E\",\"a7e7967191ef28d9affbd6aca2c6f4c328e5a8a6e71f4eafcf7e75da4a5e700f\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"K\",\"1621\"],[\"P\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"e\",\"a7e7967191ef28d9affbd6aca2c6f4c328e5a8a6e71f4eafcf7e75da4a5e700f\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"k\",\"1621\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"revision\",\"openagents.issue-revision.v1\"],[\"subject\",\"Compound assignment through a view emits valid C\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"bug\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"Revision of an issue: Compound assignment through a view emits valid C\"]],\"content\":\"`t[0].count[b] += 1` on an array field reached through a view generates C that does not compile (found building the project page). Fix the emitter and add a regression test.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- A test with `t[0].count[b] += 1` (and -=, *=, |=) through a view compiles and runs under ASan\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/emit_c.cpp`\\n- `coax/tests/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"3b6c5fd7fe97ed3bc215d82547345c81ecae992118370a52f38acf4a1a1cb6e0ec885e6160ba285d5bcb948febc797d35347486f3c8fba80fe9947de1e762b76\"}]\n[\"EOSE\",\"comments\",[\"finish\"]]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"0c13c6ed2696572356537f5a6b8340b3431a779cae2f96ae1bbb5df6f6f3f414\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793217787,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"r11a-reload-experiment\"],[\"subject\",\"R11a: replace a procedure body without relaunching (Mac experiment)\"],[\"t\",\"r11\"],[\"t\",\"tooling\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"parent\",\"3dafb6d9d2eb1c2bd4d46ad572a9aea0808d0611a2afe3d5034a2bbbb478aede\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"963ba9fc751a7e575ad782f6635f6bcafca01bd3b5567d4990f3b95e6385cecb\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: R11a: replace a procedure body without relaunching (Mac experiment)\"]],\"content\":\"The unchanged-layout Mac replacement experiment: swap a procedure body in a running app.\\n\\nRoadmap: coax/ROADMAP.md.\\n\",\"sig\":\"845f3f5eae05792a58cb0e883806e859c9c571283f7ded9dfaa46177b90f8a9ef4dda4852c989f2ec4e63b5b23f203589e95b54e934dc7f076a695e5fba9206a\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"791f07997d9b98b2a86b2f3157fcd71db650fca9cfa838f634998d3bbc9d92ee\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"