 fixed storage\"]],\"content\":\"Generic copyable values and non-owning operations over fixed storage.\\n\\nRoadmap: coax/ROADMAP.md.\\n\",\"sig\":\"8f4f00652fe1821ec134cb061ab524cbef9c4724a47e32d54b466c2c090c23bf5dce3636d5ac424f7fd3e1ebc0f5ca52002dd3838dc04a0663f16a3755a0c34d\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"6541812581360075e6a12e196f4773d4ab5c4a90b39a409098eb60f916833c80\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793217784,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"r2a-results\"],[\"subject\",\"R2a: tagged results, optionals and exhaustive switching\"],[\"t\",\"r2\"],[\"t\",\"language\"],[\"size\",\"L\"],[\"parent\",\"08f57f4e5b411eee3cea11793e980103f99b6afb6d2afc45211d9b93046e855c\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"963ba9fc751a7e575ad782f6635f6bcafca01bd3b5567d4990f3b95e6385cecb\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: R2a: tagged results, optionals and exhaustive switching\"]],\"content\":\"Typed results and optionals, exhaustive switch, propagation and exhaustive cleanup, with one real asynchronous adapter.\\n\\nRoadmap: coax/ROADMAP.md.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- The spec's R2a examples compile and their checks pass\\n\",\"sig\":\"8590a642a699681fd7af0b376a1ad89a0b8be4fe1ca082815c18163de9b46ddeacde5457423817dd2bc069a29d48adadbf01620b55dc24db0cec81b8daa36460\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"07c2bc1acfda2ce3c5cd3c98b17836e42c3a541171ac557bf4cb2067bf8a6b70\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793217783,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"