key, randomized created_at within two days back); unwrap verifies wrap sig, decrypts, verifies seal sig and that rumor pubkey equals seal pubkey.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Opens wraps made by today's coax/web/unlock/seal.ts and by nostr-effect nip44+pure\\n- Wraps it makes open with nostr-effect nip44+pure\\n- Refuses a rumor whose pubkey differs from the seal's\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/nostr/nip59.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"465bc1906403d5e2324b225157cda9839b2a28e2f7571b8d8e88ab81d622e8465e22a266fb5fa1b23b7dd944f07c7d10e9fa2dfb80affbc79632540b0309dbcf\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"7cdf2fe4a30442eba7a02e6eeafe44f90b64e24eb7fd9e231280d1f11b34e753\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214863,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"nostr-event\"],[\"subject\",\"NIP-01 events: serialize, id, sign, verify and field rules\"],[\"t\",\"nostr\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"abf5ecb9864de2dd92cf46a47832768354bf2a3a49178ab240fdfb6d49a14844\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"d2231dfceab3e2e404cb4c4bcf29a0d11ae02857a5ba4fbb1ee0331384b2e14d\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"41bdfb8f0861f587a6f0b7b8aa9e47b854da9dde7e1d659913eb0ac28e94926c\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"5c3ad1344c774e75a2dda906d5631c31c8993d0a47493bdd44f3c3c2bc60cfdf\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: NIP-01 events: serialize, id, sign, verify and field rules\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/nostr/event.coax: parse an event object, the exact NIP-01 id serialization and escaping, compute id, sign (fill pubkey/id/sig), verify (recompute id, check sig), the ingest field rules of coax/nostr.md §7.2.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Serialization fixtures with every escape class and astral characters match nostr-effect's getEventHash\\n- Events signed here verify in nostr-effect and vice versa (differential, 10,000 random events)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/nostr/event.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"d71d43cec9db3b7f2e31b67ef81404a6e138391a4cc9cfc3ebc15c5163276ecd3a825a5a2db5aa96aaa52e389642a1a1f949768dee3a08d1783f9ffd5372ec06\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"d2231dfceab3e2e404cb4c4bcf29a0d11ae02857a5ba4fbb1ee0331384b2e14d\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214862,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"nostr-json\"],[\"subject\",\"Bounded JSON pull parser and writer\"],[\"t\",\"nostr\"],[\"size\",\"L\"],[\"reward\",\"15000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"abf5ecb9864de2dd92cf46a47832768354bf2a3a49178ab240fdfb6d49a14844\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Bounded JSON pull parser and writer\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/nostr/json.coax: tokens with byte ranges, depth 16, string unescape into caller buffers (all JSON escapes, surrogate pairs), integer parsing to 2^53, refusal of anything over limits; writer appending to a caller buffer.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- JSONTestSuite y_/n_ cases relevant to RFC 8259 (pinned subset) behave correctly\\n- No allocation (checked by building with a trapping allocator)\\n- Fuzz 1 hour against a reference parser in the native harness with no crash\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/nostr/json.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"0413191cc9fe40ca983e8d795b368cab661423def607d27aff941191022cfff4e51a21a7915dfa3888974a02fdc210181e1ac1732549e884b534bca600c6060c\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"48783672d1a1652b41951c641f8331bcd3c574549b481196abb3251529dfb167\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214861,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"nip44-v2\"],[\"subject\",\"NIP-44 version 2 encrypt and decrypt\"],[\"t\",\"nostr\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"ca06a75181b2db380cb5e9a2522c0910d784670c1c2ce0f5f245e9be5e3793b9\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"f20e2fcf01473864c4e6a74bda37893d2c7b3705e68e00b759902cb0395b28f9\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"5fc9d914022e871930f5eaacbb29f1615373f22063c0dc14c89c0f0e09f2cde8\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"71e7df5f2935d6e8e3a9cd8cbafcdd25b743b9064d891661fff41271a271de0f\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"5c3ad1344c774e75a2dda906d5631c31c8993d0a47493bdd44f3c3c2bc60cfdf\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: NIP-44 version 2 encrypt and decrypt\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/nostr/nip44.coax: conversation_key (HKDF-extract with salt \\\"nip44-v2\\\"), message_keys (HKDF-expand 76 bytes), calc_padded_len, pad/unpad, encrypt (random 32-byte nonce from the caller), decrypt with constant-time MAC check over nonce||ciphertext.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Every valid and invalid case of nip44.vectors.json passes\\n- Decrypting a NIP-07 signer's ciphertext and vice versa (a manual check recorded in the PR)\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/nostr/nip44.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"f1206b1f1bf15df00ba7381a9eb044bd205d627bb77a3c84da89b5d9b438c3636c8aa4c48413b6fb3957b8d15351ac8dd16f15d80a4a489abc9490167a4ff439\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"71e7df5f2935d6e8e3a9cd8cbafcdd25b743b9064d891661fff41271a271de0f\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214860,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-ecdh-xonly\"],[\"subject\",\"x-only ECDH shared secret\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"3021a5a2952db48a66482951d1f2cc86b59131ad7911ab95ae34e1992c833e92\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"3e29fd0e72622bf43e24cd33daf0c6c457f4d81317111a98ee0707ffdf67c62b\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: x-only ECDH shared secret\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/ecdh.coax: shared_x(seckey, xonly_pub) = x(k·P) as NIP-44 requires (unhashed x coordinate).\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- NIP-44 get_conversation_key vectors' shared points match\\n- Wycheproof ecdh_secp256k1 adapted cases pass\\n- Timing |t| < 4.5 native\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/ecdh.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"ae2479413e189775b838e5cc935020cc3c51ca62867b5b235a40207efbe39007f7a789cd9bfc6227834ab73f81b7919b7b4b019d6abca3d8868e9847fc0ae83e\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"51f416c58a9c0b1b034d374a7fec805de9d9864211814cd792831113ab0f53a8\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214859,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"schnorr-sign\"],[\"subject\",\"BIP-340 signing with auxiliary randomness\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"3021a5a2952db48a66482951d1f2cc86b59131ad7911ab95ae34e1992c833e92\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"94a3347135a6feb30e2745a0f244f338d986842dfe4c34cb95280fd38899d34f\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"41bdfb8f0861f587a6f0b7b8aa9e47b854da9dde7e1d659913eb0ac28e94926c\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: BIP-340 signing with auxiliary randomness\"]],\"content\":\"sign(msg32, seckey32, aux32) per BIP-340 (negate key for odd y, tagged nonce from aux, zero-nonce refusal), keypair and xonly_pubkey; zeroizes every secret buffer.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Every signing row of BIP-340 test-vectors.csv matches byte for byte\\n- Secret scratch is all zero after return (#test reads it)\\n- Timing |t| < 4.5 native\\n- Sign ≤ 300 µs wasm32\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/schnorr.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"6691b575501aa055f06e7ce6d551c41cf0663d4796b2dfbf97d8c9bdef4a915584cef68bb422a97d5699a82ce765ad0d7b20e06e81d498c2ad6e25f6b31a3725\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"3e29fd0e72622bf43e24cd33daf0c6c457f4d81317111a98ee0707ffdf67c62b\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214858,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-mult-const\"],[\"subject\",\"Constant-time variable-base multiplication k·P\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"3021a5a2952db48a66482951d1f2cc86b59131ad7911ab95ae34e1992c833e92\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"8ee9d948eb3062e4ecb6755c77113f4926f306216c14b8230c686dcad6c1cbc4\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"0bd17619f83ed2dc6152e607c9aca14402a83a589be838a6d80ca18f99db0b0d\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Constant-time variable-base multiplication k·P\"]],\"content\":\"A fixed-window (4-bit) constant-time multiplication for ECDH, with signed-digit recoding and masked table selection.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- 100,000 random (k, P) match the harness\\n- Timing harness |t| < 4.5, native\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_mult.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"6e27f4f3c2975af8c99b64df00b807bc9ec87497339b0d6d04a410397d5bf50424d0ac35201fb61f3cf4bebb936f010f251996f7dd696e9805eed30ce401b55e\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"94a3347135a6feb30e2745a0f244f338d986842dfe4c34cb95280fd38899d34f\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214857,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-mult-base\"],[\"subject\",\"Constant-time fixed-base multiplication k·G\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"L\"],[\"reward\",\"15000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"3021a5a2952db48a66482951d1f2cc86b59131ad7911ab95ae34e1992c833e92\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"8ee9d948eb3062e4ecb6755c77113f4926f306216c14b8230c686dcad6c1cbc4\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"0bd17619f83ed2dc6152e607c9aca14402a83a589be838a6d80ca18f99db0b0d\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Constant-time fixed-base multiplication k·G\"]],\"content\":\"Comb method with a table generated by #run (32 KB variant for the page, 64 KB native); every lookup through ge_table_select; no secret branches.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- 100,000 random k match the harness\\n- Timing harness |t| < 4.5 over 10^6 runs, fixed vs random k, native\\n- Release wasm grows by ≤ 40 KB\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_mult.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"54b8017ab658ae0dfdedd00c7504678c7a06a62faf678ffd702db5584f334822a62c525c9c3d3770db69d96acc614d654a3a7f5189f170d03e25a5b59574ab9c\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"0bd17619f83ed2dc6152e607c9aca14402a83a589be838a6d80ca18f99db0b0d\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214856,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-ct-timing-harness\"],[\"subject\",\"A dudect-style constant-time timing harness\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"t\",\"tools\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"3021a5a2952db48a66482951d1f2cc86b59131ad7911ab95ae34e1992c833e92\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: A dudect-style constant-time timing harness\"]],\"content\":\"tools/coax-nostr/timing/: fixed-vs-random class runs with Welch's t-test, native (Apple silicon and x86-64) and a wasm32 report mode.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Flags a deliberately branching ct_eq (|t| > 10) and passes the real ct_eq (|t| < 4.5)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/timing/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"5c1ca0380c4418e1872a69cbce9ed75d9231b4f936c189c1eb6cf58b0d3142551ed689b51143a77784b8c445aae3e0cd6a8ef800c323fa6e4e1459075de4870a\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"69431a57b1c90581f1d71cbf5139e9413287fd9aefb0616548c3d7bed6f1333b\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214855,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"verify-one-real-event\"],[\"subject\",\"The page verifies one real event in Coax\"],[\"t\",\"web\"],[\"t\",\"nostr\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"415aa469756162d066415e784a66144b7217e3c58a11390b85bf34eeec6f3c82\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"41bdfb8f0861f587a6f0b7b8aa9e47b854da9dde7e1d659913eb0ac28e94926c\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: The page verifies one real event in Coax\"]],\"content\":\"A dev-only probe page under apps/openagents-web loads one event JSON baked at build time (fetched from relay.openagents.com by the build), recomputes its id with a minimal serializer, verifies the signature and draws VERIFIED or REFUSED.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Probe screenshot shows VERIFIED for a real event and REFUSED when one hex digit of sig is changed\\n- check-visuals.sh passes\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `apps/openagents-web/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"fdb8e453dfc1fa4f373030cfb7e0fc927c3f637cea0549580c5c50d2cfc8c9c477516c7641381844c0d28099c57df08991c96e670668677833d8bd38dee56937\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"41bdfb8f0861f587a6f0b7b8aa9e47b854da9dde7e1d659913eb0ac28e94926c\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214854,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"schnorr-verify\"],[\"subject\",\"BIP-340 Schnorr verification\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"415aa469756162d066415e784a66144b7217e3c58a11390b85bf34eeec6f3c82\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"ff0f3e69b0a60bd5f4bff2ddd7c5e46a053c3e7036eb6b84bed7f1f28e26995e\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"67846980e155bd984c7c9b0791191732f3a7921615bc413bbf7ecd168ca1b292\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: BIP-340 Schnorr verification\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/schnorr.coax: verify(sig64, msg32, xonly32) per BIP-340, refusing r ≥ p, s ≥ n and invalid public keys.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Every verification row of BIP-340 test-vectors.csv (pass and fail) matches\\n- 1 hour of differential fuzzing vs libsecp with no disagreement\\n- Verify ≤ 600 µs in wasm32 in Chrome, ≤ 100 µs native (bench)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/schnorr.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"005b7a06f7bb92c3e18fb639b1a04cc528330b57dc49a5efcbd5d375125bab298cbba042a52e8e0a83cb370578943e4621f5ec63abedf8732309ebfc42170588\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"ff0f3e69b0a60bd5f4bff2ddd7c5e46a053c3e7036eb6b84bed7f1f28e26995e\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214853,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-mult-verify\"],[\"subject\",\"wNAF dual multiplication a·G + b·P for verification\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"L\"],[\"reward\",\"15000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"415aa469756162d066415e784a66144b7217e3c58a11390b85bf34eeec6f3c82\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"8ee9d948eb3062e4ecb6755c77113f4926f306216c14b8230c686dcad6c1cbc4\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: wNAF dual multiplication a·G + b·P for verification\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/secp_mult.coax: ecmult_vartime(a, P, b) using wNAF (window 5 for P, a precomputed G table generated with #run). Public inputs only; name ends _vartime.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- 100,000 random (a, P, b) match the harness\\n- Precomputed table generated at compile time within the step budget\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_mult.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"054c491962ecdd67c1d2f6b95cd10825b6690f9cd65d362d79ed79139c84dccc31a258287c02bbafc0a030dcc9fdcd4971b27863547a2d30e5ff24bc872e6fb6\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"8ee9d948eb3062e4ecb6755c77113f4926f306216c14b8230c686dcad6c1cbc4\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214852,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-group\"],[\"subject\",\"Points: affine and Jacobian add, double and mixed add\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"L\"],[\"reward\",\"15000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"415aa469756162d066415e784a66144b7217e3c58a11390b85bf34eeec6f3c82\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"6076dbf88d4749a010d74767f252f2849d1aa17a304e4a0ee486b566bc0bb142\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"dd902da03d8d43e06d3f88e7d043e42449957f077f825693fc9e6022a43c9d07\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Points: affine and Jacobian add, double and mixed add\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/secp_group.coax: infinity handling, gej_double, gej_add_ge (mixed), gej_add, ge_set_gej, set_xo (lift x with even y, BIP-340), is_valid_xo, and constant-time table selection ge_table_select.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Generator multiples 1..1000 match the harness\\n- Doubling/adding at infinity and P + (−P) correct\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_group.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"d3d2307ef8af43fbd47bbe7c553cfb2dc48bcd449ce5cfd1c5018552146b8cb66b0f8786a3bdaa5e7b5b80899d65640e6d0a373f2725fa131877b5ce90063f32\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"dd902da03d8d43e06d3f88e7d043e42449957f077f825693fc9e6022a43c9d07\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214851,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-scalar\"],[\"subject\",\"Scalars mod n in 8×32 limbs\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"2a737385f645eff09bfab959a061fb5f9df78d4cc003826519c97795b58f7a48\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"22654f5df98515a5756053a6420ec5b184e004f565d8873bf0af1af77650e27f\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Scalars mod n in 8×32 limbs\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/secp_scalar.coax: set_b32 with overflow flag, get_b32, add, mul, negate, inverse, is_zero, constant-time cond_negate, and bit/window extraction for multiplication.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Edge values (0, 1, n−1, n, 2^256−1) and 1,000,000 random ops match the libsecp harness\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_scalar.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"119994bc9fcb6864e8c2b22b47b62a96c9ed6476cf39c0257b5ac4145c2c776b8fe55667fb7a0007f37a5594f021fe7d69fd14784931fe6251cfa2aef3be8aac\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"6076dbf88d4749a010d74767f252f2849d1aa17a304e4a0ee486b566bc0bb142\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214850,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-field-inv-sqrt\"],[\"subject\",\"Field inversion and square root with fixed addition chains\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"2a737385f645eff09bfab959a061fb5f9df78d4cc003826519c97795b58f7a48\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"51cbe7195c3e7e749848e46be30d7dae6742aba1341095259a9432ac2b88fcef\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Field inversion and square root with fixed addition chains\"]],\"content\":\"inv (a^(p−2)) and sqrt (a^((p+1)/4), returning whether a root exists), constant time, plus inv_vartime for public inputs (may initially call inv).\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- a·inv(a) = 1 for 100,000 random a; sqrt(a²) = ±a; non-residues refused\\n- Matches libsecp harness on edge values\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_field.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"ffa6af35a978dc2766021782c35a9c28a1d12265abdb8dd08f3970f8ad2533a2d4b30c1b78df62707845483ef88a7661edac2352b48b91b96eb975d56efd4ef6\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"51cbe7195c3e7e749848e46be30d7dae6742aba1341095259a9432ac2b88fcef\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214849,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-field-mul\"],[\"subject\",\"Field multiply and square with compile-time bound proofs\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"L\"],[\"reward\",\"15000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"2a737385f645eff09bfab959a061fb5f9df78d4cc003826519c97795b58f7a48\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"56843d95f261f9667c2fa8429ec068370cbddac6b448bd2e28bca78dda7725c7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"22654f5df98515a5756053a6420ec5b184e004f565d8873bf0af1af77650e27f\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Field multiply and square with compile-time bound proofs\"]],\"content\":\"mul and sqr with reduction by 2^256 ≡ 2^32 + 977; #run/#assert prove the largest accumulator stays below 2^64 for inputs of magnitude ≤ 8.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- The bound #assert fails to compile if the admitted magnitude is raised to 9 (documented negative check)\\n- 1,000,000 random products match a native libsecp256k1 harness\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_field.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"e00ac9f32d5f855076373ee50f3aac39e148f8b66b1882df55ac0d115aee388b14f5601e70f82934c3175bb43e1f1ddac3fb99f8a4d11b1d13e68a5d402940c8\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"22654f5df98515a5756053a6420ec5b184e004f565d8873bf0af1af77650e27f\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214848,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-libsecp-harness\"],[\"subject\",\"A differential harness against libsecp256k1\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"t\",\"tools\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"2a737385f645eff09bfab959a061fb5f9df78d4cc003826519c97795b58f7a48\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: A differential harness against libsecp256k1\"]],\"content\":\"tools/coax-nostr/fuzz/: fetch libsecp256k1 at a pinned tag (verify tarball hash), build it with the harness only, expose field/scalar/point/schnorr/ecdh comparisons to C drivers that call our modules. Never vendored into the tree.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/fuzz/run.sh field 60` runs 60 s with no disagreement on a correct build and finds a planted bug\\n- Tarball hash pinned and checked\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/fuzz/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"ec0b214c157c65948e6f4e5151835ed2b924c3a1c487809d09f13699b4420c0870c978df55cabbe962d06f94d5419c3512139ce64ca65efd2d9080c7a8cf7ee2\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"56843d95f261f9667c2fa8429ec068370cbddac6b448bd2e28bca78dda7725c7\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214847,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"secp-field-repr\"],[\"subject\",\"Field elements in 10×26 limbs: load, store, normalize, add, negate\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"secp256k1\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"2a737385f645eff09bfab959a061fb5f9df78d4cc003826519c97795b58f7a48\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Field elements in 10×26 limbs: load, store, normalize, add, negate\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/secp_field.coax: the representation, set_b32 (refusing ≥ p where asked), get_b32, normalize (constant time), add, negate with magnitude parameter, mul_int, is_zero, equal. Debug magnitude/normalized tracking.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- #test round-trips for 0, 1, p−1, 2^256−1 mod p and limb-boundary values\\n- Magnitude violations trap in debug builds (negative tests)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/secp_field.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"3e4a15dfd2b9a5e78c613ac720ffef9cf2d0ff78ce2a1b31427eefb7db665d69521bcec461f90af899e55dd94d4af0a56f77590207425285e99d1667469e45fb\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"5c3ad1344c774e75a2dda906d5631c31c8993d0a47493bdd44f3c3c2bc60cfdf\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214846,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"nostr-hex-base64\"],[\"subject\",\"Bounded hex and base64 codecs\"],[\"t\",\"nostr\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Bounded hex and base64 codecs\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/nostr/hex.coax and base64.coax (standard alphabet, with padding, as NIP-44 uses): encode and strict decode into caller buffers; refuse bad characters, bad padding and overflow.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- RFC 4648 §10 vectors pass\\n- Every invalid NIP-44 base64 case is refused\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/nostr/hex.coax`\\n- `coax/lib/nostr/base64.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"47bd39e15db9bb6673a8e39f91b6da002253c0f9ba5dd75ed8e099ac84af23fa3364a50d3f3a5d33d9380315c6dc316cc8c31a7ee40ab8c78efb8d3f7f037da1\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"5fc9d914022e871930f5eaacbb29f1615373f22063c0dc14c89c0f0e09f2cde8\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214845,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-chacha20\"],[\"subject\",\"ChaCha20 block function and stream cipher\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"0e80305628f5865f8215377b9ea71ee3a220fce2813307c148f3319fc0508643\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: ChaCha20 block function and stream cipher\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/chacha20.coax per RFC 8439 §2.3–2.4: 32-byte key, 12-byte nonce, 32-bit counter; xor stream into caller buffer.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- RFC 8439 §2.3.2, §2.4.2, A.1 and A.2 pass\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n- ≥ 250 MB/s in wasm32\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/chacha20.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"ffb31112ad1c2a5b7e1902f71207d7ded46382381d00712c3c708e0b408fae12fb82ab7773c275f4b01e71a54077ce3ea9997d8da79ce2f4cd996bcbf19b3f4c\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"4747fbcbf213e5c9af2f8f7d793a9b19f3b0d9ef23259ea776670da780296456\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214844,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-pbkdf2\"],[\"subject\",\"PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"f20e2fcf01473864c4e6a74bda37893d2c7b3705e68e00b759902cb0395b28f9\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/pbkdf2.coax for the phrase gate (210,000 rounds); reuse the HMAC inner/outer state per round.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- RFC 7914 §11 vectors pass\\n- 210,000 rounds take under 400 ms in wasm32 in Chrome\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/pbkdf2.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"6e4c31240097ea0efec3d0cf2fd132beec6c7c8b12dff7d5ef658897511418a406598e99a10c45404334d45f0c9f3cf86003e23669d5245cc09d8f794ce40b45\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"f20e2fcf01473864c4e6a74bda37893d2c7b3705e68e00b759902cb0395b28f9\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214843,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-hmac-hkdf\"],[\"subject\",\"HMAC-SHA256 and HKDF\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"67846980e155bd984c7c9b0791191732f3a7921615bc413bbf7ecd168ca1b292\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: HMAC-SHA256 and HKDF\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/hmac.coax and hkdf.coax: hmac_sha256(key, msg), HKDF extract and expand (NIP-44 uses expand with 76 bytes).\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- RFC 4231 cases 1–7 and RFC 5869 cases 1–3 pass\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/hmac.coax`\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/hkdf.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"394fa0c78677425636497c8d3546f34ab4a045a73fab7798993e3939e65f3992868467d600ccb32c725bbfec34d2a3e91605d40fb29539de3d6d7c920bf497bf\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"67846980e155bd984c7c9b0791191732f3a7921615bc413bbf7ecd168ca1b292\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214842,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-sha256\"],[\"subject\",\"SHA-256, streaming and one-shot, with the BIP-340 tagged hash\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"0e80305628f5865f8215377b9ea71ee3a220fce2813307c148f3319fc0508643\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: SHA-256, streaming and one-shot, with the BIP-340 tagged hash\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/sha256.coax: init/update/final over views, one-shot sha256, and tagged_hash(tag, msg) = SHA256(SHA256(tag)||SHA256(tag)||msg) with the three BIP-340 tags' prefixes precomputed with #run.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- NIST subset and the 1 MiB split-at-every-chunk test pass in the vector runner\\n- #test: empty, \\\"abc\\\", tagged hash of BIP0340/challenge known value\\n- coax mutate: no surviving mutants\\n- ≥ 150 MB/s in wasm32, ≥ 300 MB/s native (bench printed)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/sha256.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"0d525deebe04a89c3ca04ed743e49b6295d9202d290236e51168a010eb7e23c21c284ad76a19cbec13f6ca491f19a6465d2de01cc72138829a90ef0de3ef4aab\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"0e80305628f5865f8215377b9ea71ee3a220fce2813307c148f3319fc0508643\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214841,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-vector-runner\"],[\"subject\",\"A native vector runner for Coax crypto modules\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"t\",\"tools\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"blocked-by\",\"ef110244163f42af67495669bf9b2dad025e3f1fe652c59637927a9640315259\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: A native vector runner for Coax crypto modules\"]],\"content\":\"tools/coax-nostr/vectors.sh builds each module with `coax c` → clang with ASan/UBSan and runs a C driver per vector file, reporting pass/fail per row. Heavy vectors run here; small ones also run as #test.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Runs on macOS with the existing toolchain\\n- Fails loudly on a single wrong row (tested by corrupting one expected value in a temp copy)\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/vectors.sh`\\n- `tools/coax-nostr/vectors/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"2bb02eaa6071039d3cc146feb7e7339c436849826be09532caa59f59537a35127dda7cff53dad737e87d36f840da654eae14de85a0f78138c92932fa6203472c\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"ef110244163f42af67495669bf9b2dad025e3f1fe652c59637927a9640315259\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214840,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-vectors-pinned\"],[\"subject\",\"Pin the official test vectors with their sources and hashes\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"tests\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Pin the official test vectors with their sources and hashes\"]],\"content\":\"Create coax/tests/vectors/ with the files listed in coax/nostr.md §9.1 (NIST SHA-256 subset, RFC 4231, 5869, 7914, 8439, BIP-340 CSV, Wycheproof ecdh_secp256k1, NIP-44 vectors, BIP-173) and SOURCES.md recording URL, retrieval date and SHA-256 of each.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Every file in SOURCES.md matches its recorded SHA-256 (a check script)\\n- No file is modified from upstream\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/tests/vectors/`\\n- `coax/tests/vectors/SOURCES.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"ac32b18c6186d5e6b20f5d2117fdfcbe4932922495d3676dc6cb25f909ae89222e72f43e1dfb1d4c9a34d641e1960f5e015fff4f89a72a2d23f8a3bcf4f08b1f\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"993ff555b07d19c09c6be7bb909c88dca8843b422aba400720be87c0c34add90\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214839,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"crypto-bytes\"],[\"subject\",\"Byte helpers: big/little-endian loads, constant-time equality, select and zeroize\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"351453fe6079dc23cec9f2ee0c28604295624d7a68a042753a1d52718ac24ac7\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Byte helpers: big/little-endian loads, constant-time equality, select and zeroize\"]],\"content\":\"coax/lib/crypto/bytes.coax: load/store be32/le32/be64/le64, ct_eq over views (returns a mask), ct_select for u32/u64 and views, zeroize through the value barrier (a #foreign no-op until the intrinsic lands).\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- #test covers every helper at boundaries\\n- coax mutate coax/lib/crypto/bytes.coax: no surviving mutants\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/lib/crypto/bytes.coax`\\n\",\"sig\":\"bfe66636cb9f5993bdb8032678061e5fb14888f7cc9005683cd500bb8bfbef7257740e51aaae2f5b98a12005553f90bad2181e98243450d8964e62766a4bf6c3\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"7e3934a9c0d037a0aedd82652a39ce54157d1a653cd8100c4e7bdf66a00c70ca\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214838,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"coax-debug-only-fields\"],[\"subject\",\"Debug-only struct fields and checks\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Debug-only struct fields and checks\"]],\"content\":\"A way to declare fields and statements that exist only in development builds (spec §10.5 conditional compilation, the minimal slice), so field elements can carry magnitudes in debug and not in release.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- A struct with a debug-only field has a smaller size_of in --release; statements under the debug condition are absent from release C\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"61307b9eb2cecd1240a0028afca710593e68db1e05fa9d6da9828cbeb53fbf003b4777ab1e0b841d7f6d711ff27bd5ec7c0a03d16172693118a85ebfbbf2e7b2\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"cead935db7ace271e21900abbc2d2df3a2de667b26fde55a957a22b9e6cd446c\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214837,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"coax-intrinsic-mul-wide\"],[\"subject\",\"mul_wide: a 64×64→128 multiply as two u64 halves\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"optional\"],[\"size\",\"M\"],[\"reward\",\"6000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: mul_wide: a 64×64→128 multiply as two u64 halves\"]],\"content\":\"Add `mul_wide(a, b: u64) -> (hi, lo: u64)`: C emits `unsigned __int128`; wasm32 emits a four-multiply split. Enables a 5×52 field on native later.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Random and edge vectors match a reference computed with __int128 on native and in wasm32 (node or a headless page)\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"6f925f545d2bb454acbd8ec7b30b0bcd146774bdc682605f4662d421e8d83bd5e3ee542ed0edfd5579428dc05f43d2e1f51d988490feb7c57961f4e0b3438509\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"0ad56dd04b3014052d86aa154588c49234d1ff82c0d221eeaf254802e9b14202\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214836,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"coax-intrinsic-wrapping-ops\"],[\"subject\",\"Explicit wrapping add and rotate for u32 and u64\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"t\",\"optional\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Explicit wrapping add and rotate for u32 and u64\"]],\"content\":\"Add `add_wrap`, `sub_wrap`, `mul_wrap`, `rotl`, `rotr` for u32/u64 that never trap in any build mode. SHA-256 and ChaCha20 can use them instead of computing in u64 and masking.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Tests for each op at the type's limits in debug and --release\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n\",\"sig\":\"4492d9f1349e29b9af5afeceb11ad35fcbdff2282a370055cb71988d7785cc58a0195247233b240e64d2b0b87e8094426b810dd42270ec4385464ee6a7e24bb5\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"b17db3e238f978ff3415d8c228eb42683128322d8ba8212a81b823eabc4748a7\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214835,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"coax-intrinsic-value-barrier\"],[\"subject\",\"A value_barrier intrinsic for constant-time code\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"crypto\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: A value_barrier intrinsic for constant-time code\"]],\"content\":\"Add `value_barrier(x: u64) -> u64` (and u32) that the optimizer cannot see through: native emits `__asm__(\\\"\\\" : \\\"+r\\\"(x))`, wasm32 emits a call to a non-inlined identity. Document it in coax/spec.md §9.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- Generated C for a masked select compiled with clang -O2 contains no conditional branch on the masked value (checked by objdump in a test script)\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/`\\n- `coax/spec.md`\\n- `coax/tests/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"102c4f6a24cc8a07911ff8e3b9d6f3458a08f78bce872c614427d2b83f98c9b186102773042a30e77b00d272298a7d4ae011fc35846c613655db27d5b2457282\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"a7e7967191ef28d9affbd6aca2c6f4c328e5a8a6e71f4eafcf7e75da4a5e700f\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214834,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"coax-fix-compound-assign-view\"],[\"subject\",\"Compound assignment through a view emits valid C\"],[\"t\",\"compiler\"],[\"t\",\"bug\"],[\"size\",\"S\"],[\"reward\",\"2000\",\"sat\"],[\"parent\",\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\"],[\"alt\",\"A task in the Coax project: Compound assignment through a view emits valid C\"]],\"content\":\"`t[0].count[b] += 1` on an array field reached through a view generates C that does not compile (found building the project page). Fix the emitter and add a regression test.\\n\\n## Acceptance\\n\\n- A test with `t[0].count[b] += 1` (and -=, *=, |=) through a view compiles and runs under ASan\\n- coax/tests pass\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n- `coax/src/emit_c.cpp`\\n- `coax/tests/`\\n\",\"sig\":\"0a5aef10626c9eac9a192975501fa4263e152d0a1cac7cc60e5cc37e23491d1dea02a97d926766266a5c0336fe2e7271b5dc18cbfa75067a9798df545593b03e\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"78074c5465846ad23865195fc9436c66143220a3164d8cefa6e0062de3c9b373\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214833,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"compiler\"],[\"subject\",\"Coax compiler prerequisites\"],[\"t\",\"milestone\"],[\"parent\",\"72f75267f47e6638ec4eb026ddaf506a8efc543f08c80f53997b5813d29399bd\"],[\"alt\",\"A milestone in the Coax project: Coax compiler prerequisites\"]],\"content\":\"Small compiler features and fixes the stack wants; none blocks M0–M2.\\n\",\"sig\":\"ffb487bed3d4c31b8abb7ab1d4791d67169352c46917e656e8cdaafb274f5f8aa730f0458b97e601a15b79112a9e474454e873abe9612667290ed40d33badcd8\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"56535bb0d3eb500391d723bb4693a660cdcbe8c97c07a5f7a91a2b2900987376\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214832,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:coax\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"p\",\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\"],[\"slug\",\"m8-project-live\"],[\"subject\",\"The project page goes live\"],[\"t\",\"milestone\"],[\"parent\",\"72f75267f47e6638ec4eb026ddaf506a8efc543f08c80f53997b5813d29399bd\"],[\"alt\",\"A milestone in the Coax project: The project page goes live\"]],\"content\":\"/project/coax reads its project, tasks and order from the relay and signs claims in the page.\\n\",\"sig\":\"74989084948a6d5f8783011b9f17be3e4fe07b7b828da443b5b68c0c64a27d98313dc87a769f9400ee57f1349d2353da431c03f2a08aa31c9be5bd27b9ebef9c\"}]\n[\"EVENT\",\"issues\",{\"id\":\"6c0d25259ca6ef6ff8b2ff046edc5a0b95713d6a9dfabfabe916a0ab8aca35ea\",\"pubkey\":\"9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575\",\"created_at\":1793214831,\"kind\":1621,\"tags\":[[\"a\",\"30617:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a344d851d98731575:openagents\",\"wss://relay.openagents.com\"],[\"a\",\"30621:9ef92e341b43ebc5617a75cf7eca7e2e30fae41e08a0614a3